    {
      "id": "f8b8d519-76ce-47bc-a73d-95353aaa2c46",
      "title": "Observe a cena, escute a frase e ligue o espanhol ao apoio em português.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 3,
      "sequenceItem": 1,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "a455a8a8-198a-4773-a1d7-f3944e7e3d5b",
          "textContent": "<p>Observe a reação, escute e acompanhe a frase.</p><p><strong>¡No me digas!</strong></p><p>Em português: <strong>Sério?</strong></p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/d27e7b7a31844ab7b879cec48a388c42_b01-no-me-digas-scene.png?Expires=1794099689&Signature=B6Dy941IgK73MXbSyfMwYnEeqNR8sA7qzKHT5cyWzvHrbe2HlYzp5y0gbM76KohqJYt8N3y6PqZX0Bllv0Apu93Ud~Vqru1JZ9V82CjvnZFwKplEIeylyUQYiTU6SZpdq1cjZkTY1qGsX2jxqWSSB5KcHNoFwGGmEyAuW-pCAPfVDS3YrjLyLN6jO6FNNm9dVUPSJB2ZuYJRo6Tp3LXD7CpZk8k0IxXy5qYwYS1QW7kzBs7cD8UZTPNm9Smn0N9gDJCD0T5SRnzsOHF7GS9NnqZfiKY9ztxVP4qk7Y9cnw-3TDvt2diGw1DSGX5N-YMzxBev8oJx6YYEqRUZZSHXSA__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ",
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/0253c85af2534b0dbecd720c16e1a298_b01-no-me-digas.mp3?Expires=1794099689&Signature=ob3taAKxAe0FgpI3Es6OrebtO8AI88f~iFMyFlMk23UZEx3aW~l4~2reeA168eusYA3PMKfVJdlMdmNFCx3jsXP3BPPgEDEPyKvAmjUpNZ~dOumeje~5W1wzIt16HtnNlXXI7VcUefIgzkEk5zih16b5N4SyxUIVQdjBWCYdv8msX5QPxuiyt0cnCplVrdAm1aEHV-YN-GOiwFbCgBPEmDZHdwIg8eH0HEuTGUj~wEV5IoqZkBq9jHm7s0A6AwYT3AYcgT6kfLUNX9gOGGhnQqDSLi5mCDedA64KEatpN9Db17BEvuKfA1v6AdIQXSPhUkGvNpcfHpPmtcnuRB1pJQ__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ"
